      "text color" : "[0.0]",
      "content" : "Equation (36) is a special form, for the zero structural damping case d = 0, of the following: amq¨ + (ρVb + d)q˙ + ρV2c + e q = 0 (37)",
      "kids" : [ {
        "type" : "paragraph",
