        "font size" : 9.963,
        "text color" : "[0.0]",
        "content" : "geometric characteristics, three properties remain to be defined: Mθ˙, EI, and GJ. Mθ˙ is the unsteady aerodynamics term and it is defined from oscillatory aerodynamics [49]:"
