        "font" : "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
        "font size" : 9.963,
        "text color" : "[0.0]",
        "content" : "where fk is the reduced frequency, a is the ratio between c and the flexural axis position, and F and G are, respectively, the real and imaginary part of Theodorsen’s function, C(fk), such that:"
      }, {
        "type" : "paragraph",
